s(priority)` - Shorthand for priority coloring\n\n4. **Backwards Compatibility:** `legacyColorToIntent()` maps old color props to semantic intents.\n\n### Usage Example\n\n```tsx\nfunction ConfidenceIndicator({ score }: { score: number }) {\n  const { forConfidence, badgeClasses } = useSemanticColors();\n  const colors = forConfidence(score);\n\n  return (\n    <span className={`${colors.bg} ${colors.text} ${colors.border} border rounded px-2`}>\n      {Math.round(score * 100)}%\n    </span>\n  );\n}\n```\n\nThis ensures \"high confidence\" always means emerald/green across all components, while \"contradiction\" always means rose/red, providing visual consistency throughout the application.","session_id":"bb700aba-f9fc-4283-93cf-561e37220b63","total_cost_usd":2.5566707500000003,"usage":{"input_tokens":22,"cache_creation_input_tokens":152919,"cache_read_input_tokens":2449784,"output_tokens":15017,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":152919,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0}},"modelUsage":{"claude-opus-4-5-20251101":{"inputTokens":22,"outputTokens":15017,"cacheReadInputTokens":2449784,"cacheCreationInputTokens":152919,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":2.55617075,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000},"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":340,"outputTokens":32,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.0005,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"uuid":"051055fe-6f98-422c-ad6d-8a4e8e162422"}
